    <guid isPermaLink="false">6910d9b3d99642be963cd701</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 09 Nov 2025 18:34:03 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>米津玄师， </span><a href="https://music.apple.com/cn/album/lemon/1537460610?i=1537460612" data-url="https://music.apple.com/cn/album/lemon/1537460610?i=1537460612"><span>Lemon&nbsp;</span></a></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="254">04:14</a> 无形的风筝线是自愿的羁绊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="343">05:43</a> 和爷爷的最后一次年夜饭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="475">07:55</a> 照料者和被照料者的心情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="705">11:45</a> 他们也希望我不要停止探索</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="788">13:08</a> 一次最好的告别</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="969">16:09</a> 对仪式感的新认识</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1044">17:24</a> 和身边的人一起面对所有生活中的每一个浪花</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1170">19:30</a> 我是自由的风筝，有根隐形的线提醒我不是一个人</span></p>]]></description>
