  <item>
    <title>EP16 通往自由灵魂的必经之路（下）-与Ego和平共处。用更好的心态告别拖延症、告别空虚感</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64dbba86e490c5dee58b997c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64dbba86e490c5dee58b997c</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 15 Aug 2023 17:48:54 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>魏如萱，</span><a href="https://music.apple.com/cn/album/have-a-nice-day/1568844070?i=1568844079" data-url="https://music.apple.com/cn/album/have-a-nice-day/1568844070?i=1568844079"><span>Have a nice day</span></a></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="51">00:51</a> 情场失意，我经历了什么心理变化？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="160">2:40</a> 先从多巴胺狂欢开始，吃吃喝喝买买</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="187">3:07</a> 灵感点1: 心理暗示让我察觉不对劲了。表面忙碌，内心空虚。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="330">5:30</a> 灵感点2:拖延症让灵魂和快乐暂停了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="374">6:14</a> 找到关键点，Ego 在作祟</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="400">6:40</a> Ego 究竟是什么？完美主义和拖延症的关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="465">7:45</a> 面对不如意，人正常的心理变化（和面对死亡是一样的）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="540">9:00</a> 由Ego给自己贴上的标签拉长了修复进进度</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="635">10:35</a> 先了解 Ego 形成原理，想象的身份和现实之间的鸿沟</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="745">12:25</a> 拖延症是结果，精力管理失衡是原因。了解4大精力账户</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1050">17:30</a> Ego世界的我对完美主义的执念</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1140">19:00</a> 重新出发！对欲望和需求的审视。要爱具体的人和真实的生活</span></p>]]></description>
