  <item>
    <title>EP13 在爸妈撒完一顿狗粮背后看到，更年期的课题也是子女的，应当抱团度过！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/637cd1b37105b234344c0db1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">637cd1b37105b234344c0db1</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 22 Nov 2022 13:42:10 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>本期话题：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="50">00:50</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="110">1:50</a> 爸妈的狗粮吃的很开心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="111">1:51</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="297">4:57</a> 岁月的痕迹，爸爸妈妈多了一些白头发和皱纹</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="298">4:58</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="355">5:55</a> 你是否也有近乡情怯的拧巴感？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="356">5:56</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="482">8:02</a> 原来我才是有分离焦虑的那个人，只是用暂时逃避的方式掩盖了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="483">8:03</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="542">9:02</a> 中年空巢期</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="543">9:03</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="689">11:29</a> 报喜不报忧可能是对彼此不够信任的表现</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="690">11:30</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="839">13:59</a> 老妈问我为什么不谈恋爱，终于我给了一个她满意的答复</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="840">14:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="870">14:30</a>人们是有追求更好的自己的愿望的，在他们感觉安全的前提下</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="871">14:31</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="988">16:28</a> 抱团啊！发觉新的家庭角色，成为家庭非暴力沟通师</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>参考书籍：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>非暴力沟通，马歇尔·卢森堡</span></p><span></span><p><span>人本主义心理学的主要代表人物之一，卡尔·罗杰斯</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lg8NJ_kdJOFOVdlCwj82jtGlzyVl.m4a" length="8951395" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:17:19</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqBtKtfmzbsHRyyf6-Bhb9gmoeJA.jpg"/>
